  "about": "The \"from today\" rule of the Inbox, shared by Swift (InboxToday) and Go (db.IsFromToday): in the zone tz, an item is from today when MAX(created_at, mentioned_at) is at or after the first instant of now's local date (local midnight, or the first instant after a DST gap that swallows midnight). Times are RFC 3339 UTC; mentioned_at \"\" (or null) = none. expected is the answer.",
